id: like-the-dead
name: Like the Dead
advancement: true
prerequisite: Tenacity Score 7+
tpCost: 4
# "When struck by an attack while Hidden from an Opponent(s) through the effects of Fake Death by an Opponent who you
# are not Hidden from, you may spend 4(T) Ki Points to make a Clash (Bluff vs Intuition) against the attacking
# Character. Increase your Dice Score for this Clash by 1d4. If you win, you become Hidden to that Character."
# Offered on the same card as Fake Death's, when the hit lands (chat.mjs offerFakeDeath).
likeTheDead: true
likeTheDeadKiPerTier: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Struck, while you fake it, by an Opponent you are not Hidden from: 4(T) KP for a Clash (Bluff vs Intuition) at 1d4
  more - won, Hidden from them too.
text: >
  Like the Dead: Your act is so good that even those not initially fooled start to believe otherwise.
  –Prerequisites: Tenacity Score 7+
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: When struck by an attack while Hidden from an Opponent(s) through the effects of Fake Death by an Opponent
  who you are not Hidden from, you may spend 4(T) Ki Points to make a Clash (Bluff vs Intuition) against the attacking
  Character. Increase your Dice Score for this Clash by 1d4. If you win, you become Hidden to that Character.
